1
00:00:19,062 --> 00:00:21,619
Keep going. Don't stop, damn it.”

2
00:00:52,863 --> 00:00:53,812
I'm leaving.”

3
00:00:58,069 --> 00:00:58,843
Are you mad at me?”

4
00:00:59,532 --> 00:01:02,121
Oh my god, look at yourself.
Do you even realize what you just did?”

5
00:01:08,741 --> 00:01:10,741
I didn't even do anything yet.”

6
00:01:16,407 --> 00:01:18,407
Are you scared because you can't accept
what you're feeling yourself?”

7
00:01:18,693 --> 00:01:19,881
Shut up. Don't go there.”

8
00:01:21,253 --> 00:01:23,253
Fine, I won't say anything.”

9
00:01:24,113 --> 00:01:26,113
But if you ever want to—”
